        "Title": "The Thorns In Kronsadt&apos;s Side",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111406607621",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b0d0651-4f81-40e5-bf2a-5aec6fd763a5).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47, Robert Knox has hired us to get rid of some thorns in his side. Ted Mendez is competetion, Max Rutter is angry with Robert, Fishy Joe is cutting into ticket sales, Albert Noah has blackmail information, and Finn Wheeler won&apos;t stop complaining about the soda machines. Sierra would prefer if you let her take out Albert by setting him up and Robert would prefer to see Ted shredded. You can&apos;t be on the security camera footage or kill an innocent. That would be bad for business.",
